Package: seal-companion
Version: 0.3.0
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: William <williamtovaru@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-pip
Description: SEAL Companion — Personal AI assistant
 Standalone SEAL Companion with local SQLite memory, FTS5 search,
 Anthropic Claude BYOK, MCP facility (registry+scaffold+tool calling),
 SSE streaming chat, and local AI via Ollama. No team backend required.
